{504}{I am not sure why you did it, but you have committed us to slaughtering everyone in Stillwater, so I suppose that is our next step. I'm beginning to see the strength of your determination, and it impresses me.}{I am not sure why you did it, but you have committed us to slaughtering everyone in Stillwater, so I suppose that is our next step. I'm beginning to see the strength of your determination, and it impresses me.}{}{27}{}{}
