{512}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{513}{What, that old fool? He's been dead for centuries, he simply isn't aware of it. You have the true spirit of Nasrudin, raining death on those that would oppose you! I do not know from religions and prophecies or reincarnations, but you have proven yourself worthy of my loyalty.}{What, that old fool? He's been dead for centuries, he simply isn't aware of it. You have the true spirit of Nasrudin, raining death on those that would oppose you! I do not know from religions and prophecies or reincarnations, but you have proven yourself worthy of my loyalty.}{}{30}{}{}
{514}{K:}{}{1}{}{300}{}
{515}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{516}{This place? You know...its where this whole bloody circus started.  The Living One returning on wings of fire and all that.  Things were a lot different back then, huh?}{This place? You know...its where this whole bloody circus started.  The Living One returning on wings of fire and all that.  Things were a lot different back then, huh?}{}{31}{}{}
{517}{K:}{}{1}{}{300}{}
{518}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{519}{Something wrong?  Not at all.  If anything, I'm more of myself than I've been in a long time.  You've shown me that I don't have to live by some ridiculously stringent moral code.  I can be who I want and when I want.  So there's nothing wrong me at all.  In fact I should thank you.  So thanks...}{Something wrong?  Not at all.  If anything, I'm more of myself than I've been in a long time.  You've shown me that I don't have to live by some ridiculously stringent moral code.  I can be who I want and when I want.  So there's nothing wrong me at all.  In fact I should thank you.  So thanks...}{}{32}{}{}
